						<blockquote>
							<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit. Recusandae, necessitatibus. Impedit id qui suscipit, quas unde dolorum eveniet odio ullam tenetur ipsa expedita vero maiores excepturi rerum ipsam repudiandae doloremque!</p>
						</blockquote>
						<p>They point to gaps in task definition, instruction design, example coverage and review discipline. Fix those, and model behavior stabilizes, not because randomness disappeared, but because the training signal became consistent. That’s the philosophy behind TrainAI by RWS: treat AI training data as infrastructure, design it with intent, validate it continuously and scale it responsibly.</p>
